{{News Poll|qtext=Poll Question #18 (UIM only)|2='''Should Ultimate Iron players be able to store the Abyssal tentacle in the S.T.A.S.H. unit near Miss Schism in Draynor Village?'''}}

{{News Poll|qtext=Poll Question #19 (UIM only)|2='''Should Ultimate Iron players be able to store the Guardian boots in the S.T.A.S.H. unit west of the pier in Zul-Andra?'''}}

